Numbered enacted Local Laws: official legislative texts of the City of New York, published by the New York City Council at https://legistar.council.nyc.gov/Legislation.aspx . The collection identifies the Council record and separately numbered enacted PDF for every included instrument. These texts are government edicts; no rights in City website design, marks or other copyrightable site material are claimed.
